Arbor
=====

Arbor is an independent shell for structured data.

Arbor began as a rewrite of Nushell, and keeps that project's language and
command set because they are good and well understood. This file records the
provenance of the code and the changes made since.

Upstream project: Nushell (https://github.com/nushell/nushell)
Upstream version this work began from: 0.117.0
Upstream commit: a481925 (tag 0.117.0)
Date Arbor diverged: 2026-11-10

