Keeping current with upstream
-----------------------------

    git remote add upstream https://github.com/nushell/nushell
    git fetch upstream --tags
    git merge upstream/main

Upstream merges are no longer a trivial fast-forward: because the crates and
diagnostic namespace have been renamed, an upstream merge brings conflicts in
package manifests and error attributes that must be re-applied to the `arbor-*`
names. The mapping is mechanical (prefix `nu` -> `arbor`), and `NOTICE` and
`LICENSE` must stay intact.
